  "The equation yields a value between +1 and -1. This value represents a weighted average of the polarization of detected photons if each detection of vertical polarization is mapped to a value of +1 and each detection of horizontal polarization is mapped to a value of -1. This value can also be mapped to a vector representation that lies between the value of +1 and -1.": "该方程得出的值介于 +1 和 -1 之间。如果将每次检测到垂直偏振映射为 +1，将每次检测到水平偏振映射为 -1，则该值表示所检测到光子偏振的加权平均值。该值也可以映射为介于 +1 和 -1 之间的矢量表示。",
  "This simulation is limited to vertical forces, without considering torque. Object rotations and other more complex movements are not considered in the model.": "该模拟仅限于竖直方向的力，不考虑力矩。模型中不考虑物体旋转及其他更复杂的运动。",
  "While other decays may exist, the available decays shown are the most common. In cases where there is no known decay, no available decays are shown.": "虽然可能存在其他衰变，但显示的可用衰变是最常见的。在没有已知衰变的情况下，不显示可用衰变。",
  "A full, interactive chart of the nuclides and their decays is available from Energy Education Project at University of Calgary, see {{link}}.": "完整的交互式核素及其衰变图可在 Energy Education Project at University of Calgary 获取，参见 {{link}}。",
  "Hear phrase read automatically each time addends change. When toggled on, auto-read phrase may interfere with screen readers.": "每次加数变化时自动朗读短语。开启后，自动朗读短语可能会干扰屏幕阅读器。",
  "Determines the maximum number of kicks allowed for all screens. The maximum number of kicks on the Median screen is 15.": "确定所有屏幕允许的最大踢击次数。中位数屏幕的最大踢击次数为 15。",
  "<b>Level {{levelNumber}}</b>: Match the pink waveform using <u><b>{{numberOfHarmonics}} or more</b></u> harmonics.": "<b>级别 {{levelNumber}}</b>：使用<u><b>{{numberOfHarmonics}} 个或更多</b></u>谐波匹配粉色波形。",
  "<total>{{total}}</total> can be decomposed into <left>{{leftAddend}}</left> and <right>{{rightAddend}}</right>": "<total>{{total}}</total> 可分解为 <left>{{leftAddend}}</left> 和 <right>{{rightAddend}}</right>",
